       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INVOICE.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-ITEM-NAME        PIC X(20) VALUE "COBOL BOOK".
       01  WS-QUANTITY         PIC 9(03) VALUE 003.
       01  WS-UNIT-PRICE       PIC 9(05)V99 VALUE 00049.95.
       01  WS-TAX-RATE         PIC V999 VALUE .082.
       01  WS-SUBTOTAL         PIC 9(07)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TAX              PIC 9(07)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-TOTAL            PIC 9(07)V99 VALUE ZERO.
       01  WS-MONEY            PIC $$$,$$9.99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MULTIPLY WS-QUANTITY BY WS-UNIT-PRICE GIVING WS-SUBTOTAL.
           MULTIPLY WS-SUBTOTAL BY WS-TAX-RATE GIVING WS-TAX ROUNDED.
           ADD WS-SUBTOTAL TO WS-TAX GIVING WS-TOTAL.

           DISPLAY "ITEM: " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ITEM-NAME).
           DISPLAY "QUANTITY: " WS-QUANTITY.
           MOVE WS-SUBTOTAL TO WS-MONEY.
           DISPLAY "SUBTOTAL: " WS-MONEY.
           MOVE WS-TAX TO WS-MONEY.
           DISPLAY "TAX: " WS-MONEY.
           MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-MONEY.
           DISPLAY "TOTAL: " WS-MONEY.
           GOBACK.
